<title>USA: Roanoke Electric Q2 $0.47 vs $0.41.</title>
<headline>Roanoke Electric Q2 $0.47 vs $0.41.</headline>
<dateline>ROANOKE, Va. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>ROANOKE ELECTRIC STEEL CORP</p>
<p>			     6 months Ended	3 months Ended</p>
<p>		    4/30/97	4/30/96	4/30/97     4/30/96</p>
<p> Net Sales  $119,651,630 $116,573,610 $61,299,896 $58,144,393</p>
